{
  "abstract": "Cross sections, mass spectra, angular distributions and several other features of \u039e \u2212 and \u03a9 \u2212 production from photons and neutrons in K \u2212 d interactions at 4.93 GeV/ c are presented. A five standard deviation peak is observed in \u039e K \u03c0 mass spectra near 2.6 GeV/ c 2 . A sharp rise in the \u039e \u2212 three- and four-body cross sections from K \u2212 n interactions suggests direct-channel \u03a3 \u2217 (3.0\u20133.5) formation.",
